  'field_1' => 'How to choose your bridesmaids dresses&#33;',
  'field_2' => '[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]Here are 4 tips that will help you to make the best decision!!![/size][/font][/color]',
  'field_3' => '[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]1.-Put yourself in their shoes:[/size][/font][/color]<br />
[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]Imagine that you are going to use it. Choose a nice and comfortable style, something that you would be glad to use.[/size][/font][/color]<br />
<br />
[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]2.-Allow them to choose the dress type:[/size][/font][/color]<br />
[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]Not all dresses go well with all body types. Note that the bodies of your ladies are very different and might require a different cut to look good.[/size][/font][/color]<br />
<br />
[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]3.-Keep your dress in mind:[/size][/font][/color]<br />
[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]If your dress is classic, choose a similar style for them. If you wear ornaments such as bead work, lace or flowers have them wear something that also incorporates this element.[/size][/font][/color]<br />
<br />
[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]4.-Keep in mind the style of wedding:[/size][/font][/color]<br />
[color=#000000][font=lato][size=4]Always keep in mind the colors &amp; style of your wedding… So everything will be aligned with your wedding concept.[/size][/font][/color]',
